    "updated_at": "2026-06-01T18:02:52Z",
    "body": "I don't think there was any web compat issues driving this behavior. Making it possible to use `<button>` in `<select>` was a new thing. I suppose that there is some risk in changing it now, but I think that is quite low and I'm happy to try changing it.",
